el no ParkShoppingBarigüí\n• Educação: Universidade Positivo (Campus Ecoville)\n• Lazer \\u0026 cultura: Parque Barigui e Teatro Positivo (UP Experience)\n• Mobilidade: Terminal Campo Comprido e acessos pelo eixo Prof. Pedro Viriato Parigot de Souza / Dep. Heitor Alencar Furtado\n\nAgende sua visita e venha sentir, de perto, como é morar com esse nível de conforto no Ecoville.\nValores e disponibilidade sujeitos a alteração sem aviso prévio.\n\n#HelborLandscapeEcoville #EcovilleCuritiba #CuritibaPR #AltoPadraoCuritiba #Apartamento4Suites #4Vagas #CondominioClubeCuritiba #ParqueBarigui #ParkShoppingBarigui #UniversidadePositivo #CampoComprido #ImoveisCuritiba #InvestimentoImobiliario25:[\"$\",\"$L29\",null,{\"details\":{\"id\":\"6aae8382-a9c9-42b9-a3a2-8d","fotos":["https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20250820162706/IMG_3633-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20250807202548/x-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20250820163020/IMG_5924-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20250807202308/x-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20250820162707/IMG_3624-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20250820162707/IMG_3629-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20250820162707/IMG_3630-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20250820162705/IMG_3617-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20250820162715/IMG_3637-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloudfront.net/CRM_WebP/MY%20BROKER%20CURITIBA/uploads/20250820162715/IMG_3642-watermarked.webp","https://d3873uwf1n1xlo.cloud